rray is made exclusive once. `k` receives a proof that\nthe array still has its size `S`.","docLink":"./MPN64/Arch/MulBasecase.html#MPN.W64.addMul1LoopK","kind":"def","line":459,"name":"MPN.W64.addMul1LoopK","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Arch/MulBasecase.lean#L459-L469"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Arch/MulBasecase.html#MPN.W64.size_mul1Loop\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">size_mul1Loop</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">arr</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.UInt64Array\">ScalarArray.UInt64Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">rs</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./MPN64/Arch/UIntArray.html#ScalarArray.UInt64Array.USlice\">ScalarArray.UInt64Array.USlice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hn</span> : <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./MPN64/Arch/UIntArray.html#ScalarArray.UInt64Array.USlice.size\">size</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hr</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">arr</span>.<a href=\"./MPN64/Arch/UIntArray.html#ScalarArray.UInt64Array.LoopBound\">LoopBound</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">rs</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class